{"3605910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Don't Drop Dead", "steam_appid": 3605910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a team of government stalkers. Your mission is to clean up the aftermath of failed experiments in laboratories that studied other dimensions. Your superiors are driven by personal gain, so collecting unknown artifacts for subsequent sale is also part of your duties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The locations of your missions operate by their own rules—will you be able to master them all?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your death will not be in vain.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605910/extras/12d2483faf54ecd3040cff7720382eb1.poster.avif?t=1743517722\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605910/extras/12d2483faf54ecd3040cff7720382eb1.webm?t=1743517722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605910/extras/12d2483faf54ecd3040cff7720382eb1.mp4?t=1743517722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Each stalker has unique traits that manifest upon death.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605910/extras/1820e9821fc01725c9fbf1b63c6d226b.poster.avif?t=1743517722\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605910/extras/1820e9821fc01725c9fbf1b63c6d226b.webm?t=1743517722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605910/extras/1820e9821fc01725c9fbf1b63c6d226b.mp4?t=1743517722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enemies—or perhaps friends, depending on your perspective—await you at the mission sites.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605910/extras/f3e87f91fb8a6072981bab1e08557313.poster.avif?t=1743517722\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605910/extras/f3e87f91fb8a6072981bab1e08557313.webm?t=1743517722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605910/extras/f3e87f91fb8a6072981bab1e08557313.mp4?t=1743517722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Be cautious when collecting artifacts—contact with them can have unpredictable consequences.</h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a team of government stalkers. Your mission is to clean up the aftermath of failed experiments in laboratories that studied other dimensions. Your superiors are driven by personal gain, so collecting unknown artifacts for subsequent sale is also part of your duties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The locations of your missions operate by their own rules—will you be able to master them all?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your death will not be in vain.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605910/extras/12d2483faf54ecd3040cff7720382eb1.poster.avif?t=1743517722\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605910/extras/12d2483faf54ecd3040cff7720382eb1.webm?t=1743517722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605910/extras/12d2483faf54ecd3040cff7720382eb1.mp4?t=1743517722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Each stalker has unique traits that manifest upon death.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605910/extras/1820e9821fc01725c9fbf1b63c6d226b.poster.avif?t=1743517722\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605910/extras/1820e9821fc01725c9fbf1b63c6d226b.webm?t=1743517722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605910/extras/1820e9821fc01725c9fbf1b63c6d226b.mp4?t=1743517722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enemies—or perhaps friends, depending on your perspective—await you at the mission sites.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605910/extras/f3e87f91fb8a6072981bab1e08557313.poster.avif?t=1743517722\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605910/extras/f3e87f91fb8a6072981bab1e08557313.webm?t=1743517722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605910/extras/f3e87f91fb8a6072981bab1e08557313.mp4?t=1743517722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Be cautious when collecting artifacts—contact with them can have unpredictable consequences.</h2>", "short_description": "Don't Drop Dead is a session-based cooperative extraction game played in first-person perspective. Abandoned scientific facilities are already awaiting stalkers hungry for artifacts, but beware—these places can change the rules of the game at any moment... as can you yourself. Or your teammate.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Japanese, Bulgarian, Portuguese - Brazil, Hungarian, Vietnamese, Greek, Danish, Indonesian, Korean, Dutch, Norwegian, Polish, Romanian, Thai, Turkish, Finnish, Czech, Swedish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605910/06fb537d57ab46cc6d2bd23050b7742c6b0c1bdb/header.jpg?t=1743517722", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605910/f6b8f919e238054c237d953ff2fb79ccbdbd9850/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743517722", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605910/f6b8f919e238054c237d953ff2fb79ccbdbd9850/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743517722", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GT 1030<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Inegration<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> no</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia 3060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Inegration<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> no</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["RootGame"], "publishers": ["RootGame"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, 